Tinyxml2 10.0.0 is unchanged upstream source under the zlib license in
LICENSE.txt. The recipe builds its static C++ library with standard FILE APIs.

Upstream SaveFile ignores output and fclose failures. XML_SUCCESS does not
establish complete output or storage durability; this package adds no new
error-reporting API. Caller-owned FILE streams permit independent ferror,
fflush and fclose checks. Path-based SaveFile hides its stream.

Original Pyxis recipe, build files and documentation use MPL-2.0. Their complete
source is installed under share/tinyxml2/pyxis, with the license alongside this
notice. Upstream code and notices retain their own terms.
